/* Wishweave Wonders — image loader (docs/ARCHITECTURE.md §9).
   const loader = WW.ui.createLoader(WW.ASSETS);
   loader.run(onProgress)   loads + decodes every WW.ASSETS.images entry that is not loaded yet; each image gets
